{"id":"6e228478af514c07","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-glb-nice-normalization.md","title":"Effective Normalization of Nice GLB Presentations","display":"lem-glb-nice-normalization — Effective Normalization of Nice GLB Presentations","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-glb-nice-normalization","aliases":["89-lem-glb-nice-normalization"],"display":"lem-glb-nice-normalization — Effective Normalization of Nice GLB Presentations","depends_on":["[[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]]","[[89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison]]","[[89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation]]","[[89-df-glb-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-glb-nice-normalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-glb-nice-normalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-glb-nice-normalization — Effective Normalization of Nice GLB Presentations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e82c18eddcbe3ca2\" href=\"?note=e82c18eddcbe3ca2\" title=\"89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form\">89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"15ef78b25d5206a3\" href=\"?note=15ef78b25d5206a3\" title=\"89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison\">89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"34a172f6f4cae8dd\" href=\"?note=34a172f6f4cae8dd\" title=\"89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation\">89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a> 的双模态定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}(N)\\)</span> 使用输入编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{\\mathsf{Expr}}\">\\(g_{\\mathsf{Expr}}\\)</span> 和输出编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{\\mathcal C^{&lt;\\omega}}\">\\(g_{\\mathcal C^{&lt;\\omega}}\\)</span>，二者均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e82c18eddcbe3ca2\" href=\"?note=e82c18eddcbe3ca2\" title=\"89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form\">89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form</a>；程序只须在声明域的输入码上停机。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ev}\">\\(\\mathrm{ev}\\)</span> 为 nice presentation 的布尔翻译。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}nice\\text{-}normalization}\\vdash\n\\exists N:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\mathcal C_B^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Comp}(N)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ev}(e)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\Phi(N(e)_k)\\mid k&lt;|N(e)|\\rangle\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}nice\\text{-}normalization}\\vdash\n\\exists N:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\mathcal C_B^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Comp}(N)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ev}(e)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\Phi(N(e)_k)\\mid k&lt;|N(e)|\\rangle\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}(N)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{g_{\\mathsf{Expr}},g_{\\mathcal C^{&lt;\\omega}}}(N)\n\\quad(N:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\mathcal C_B^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Comp}(N)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{g_{\\mathsf{Expr}},g_{\\mathcal C^{&lt;\\omega}}}(N)\n\\quad(N:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\mathcal C_B^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 pp.215–216，Stage 1。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>算法先作有限命题 CNF，含正 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\infty\">\\(H_\\infty\\)</span> 或正 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_\\infty\">\\(C_\\infty\\)</span> 的子句为恒真，直接删去。每个其他析取子句可插入恒假项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg H_\\infty\">\\(\\neg H_\\infty\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C_\\infty\">\\(\\neg C_\\infty\\)</span>；正 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_j\">\\(C_j\\)</span> 项可插入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_0\">\\(H_0\\)</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_0=\\Box_0\\bot\\to C_j\">\\(H_0=\\Box_0\\bot\\to C_j\\)</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 的序数蕴含链与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的指数蕴含链，负项各保留最小索引，正项各保留最大索引，得到三种候选形状。</p>\n<p>若有正 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\beta\">\\(H_\\beta\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\le\\beta\">\\(\\alpha\\le\\beta\\)</span>，或有正 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_j\">\\(C_j\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\le j\">\\(i\\le j\\)</span>，子句恒真，删去。剩余第三种用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C_j\">\\(\\neg C_j\\)</span> 条件下的截断等价，将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\)</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha^{-j},\\beta^{-j}\">\\(\\alpha^{-j},\\beta^{-j}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 保持不变；截断后若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\le\\beta\">\\(\\alpha\\le\\beta\\)</span> 再删恒真项，否则成为第三类合格记录。其他两种直接成为第一/第二类记录。</p>\n<p>固定 CNF 分配顺序、索引排序及重复删除顺序即可得确定总程序。这里“最大/最小”仅针对一个有限子句；没有对整个序数码集做无界搜索。所有改写依据上游等价式；此段即原书 Stage 1 的有限算法证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e82c18eddcbe3ca2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"15ef78b25d5206a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation","status":"resolved","id":"34a172f6f4cae8dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$ 为 [[89-df-glb-logic]] 的双模态定理集。","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e82c18eddcbe3ca2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Comp}(N)$ 使用输入编码 $g_{\\mathsf{Expr}}$ 和输出编码 $g_{\\mathcal C^{<\\omega}}$，二者均取 [[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]]；程序只须在声明域的输入码上停机。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}(N)","display":false},{"tex":"g_{\\mathsf{Expr}}","display":false},{"tex":"g_{\\mathcal C^{<\\omega}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ev}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}nice\\text{-}normalization}\\vdash\n\\exists N:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\mathcal C_B^{<\\omega}\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Comp}(N)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ev}(e)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\Phi(N(e)_k)\\mid k<|N(e)|\\rangle\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}(N)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{g_{\\mathsf{Expr}},g_{\\mathcal C^{<\\omega}}}(N)\n\\quad(N:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\mathcal C_B^{<\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"H_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"C_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg H_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg C_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"C_j","display":false},{"tex":"H_0","display":false},{"tex":"H_0=\\Box_0\\bot\\to C_j","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\le\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"C_j","display":false},{"tex":"i\\le j","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg C_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha^{-j},\\beta^{-j}","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\le\\beta","display":false}],"bytes":2552,"backlinks":[{"id":"17034fdfe7fbba71","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-glb-nice-normalization]]、[[89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form]]、[[89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-lem-glb-nice-normalization]] → [[89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision]]：固定原正规化算法所用的 presentation 与子句编码。"}],"outgoing":["e82c18eddcbe3ca2","15ef78b25d5206a3","34a172f6f4cae8dd","5a9efa2261b8f73c"]}